flowchart TD
    JSON[JSON configuration] --> Config[Config loader and validator]
    Config --> CPU[CPU]
    Config --> Assembler[Assembler]
    Config --> Editor[Graphical configurator]
    Editor -->|save JSON / launch| JSON
    Assembler -->|program bytes| CPU
    CPU --> Registers[RegisterFile: physical registers and aliases]
    CPU --> Memory[Memory: segments, Harvard or unified spaces, MMIO]
    CPU --> ALU[ALU: expressions and programs]
    CPU --> Executor[Executor and Decoder]
    CPU --> Peripherals[Declarative peripherals]
    Executor --> Registers
    Executor --> Memory
    Executor --> ALU
    Memory <-->|read / write hooks| Peripherals
    Peripherals -->|interrupt request| Executor
    UI[Simulator GUI] -->|controls and inspection| CPU
    UI --> Assembler
    Worker[CPU worker thread] -->|step instruction under mutex| CPU
    UI -.->|shared CPU mutex| Worker
    CPU -->|each step_uop| Executor
    CPU -->|tick after each step_uop| Peripherals
